Package: dicomtk.server
Title: Multi-User Server, Honest Broker Custody, and Event Routing for 'DICOM'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yee How", "Lau", email = "lauyeehow1986@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: Multi-user research server and honest-broker custody satellite
    for 'dicomtk'. Provides eight-role OpenID Connect ('OIDC') and 'Keycloak'
    role-based access control ('RBAC'), a tamper-evident SHA-256 hash-chained
    JSONL audit trail, a walled-off honest-broker key and crosswalk custody
    enclave with two-person ('honest_broker' and 'dpo') re-identification
    approval, 'mirai' asynchronous job queues, 3D segmentation quality
    assurance ('Dice', 'HD95', and surface 'Dice'), 'MONAI Label' active
    learning, event-driven routing, and 'plumber' REST and 'shiny' clinician
    portal interfaces.
